  "description": "PostgreSQL (pgvector) vector store implementation for Mythosia VectorDb. Provides PostgresStore with multi-strategy similarity search (Cosine, Euclidean, InnerProduct), metadata jsonb filtering, namespace isolation, persisted content_tsv full-text indexing for hybrid search, pg_trgm trigram-based word_similarity for CJK languages, typed index settings (HNSW/IVFFlat/NoIndex), connection verification, and schema provisioning support.",
